摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Select text in replies, diffs, or files → annotate → send with a message; replies address each annotation in order, with source navigation for easy reference.","id":"gh:1336833744","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-annotation","slug":"ruisenbai/dsh-annotation","topics":["annotation","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","messages","session"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Select text in replies, diffs, or files → annotate → send with a message; replies address each annot"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"ation in order, with source navigation for easy reference."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"kind: package-bundle\ndescription: Select text in replies, diffs, or files → annotate → send with a m"},{"id":"p2s2","text":"essage; replies address each annotation in order, with source navigation for easy reference."},{"id":"p3s1","text":"# DSH Annotation"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Summary"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"Select text in replies, diffs, or files → annotate → send with a message. Replies address each annot"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"ation in order, and source navigation makes notes easy to look up. A per-Session record keeps annota"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"tions and the current attachment selection together. The plugin sends notes with the official compos"},{"id":"p6s4","text":"er's text, images, and files; unsent work stays in the current browser."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**Version 1.1.7 requires DSH `>=0.2.2-alpha.3`; verification targets master commit `8bd073392e`.** S"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ee upgrading before updating an older Host."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"## Contents"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- Install and upgrade\n- Supported sources\n- Create and edit notes\n- Records and attachments\n- Send, "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"resend, and retry\n- Delete and recover\n- Settings\n- Data and limitations\n- Model experience\n- Develo"},{"id":"p9s3","text":"etry\n- Delete and recover\n- Settings\n- Data and limitations\n- Model experience\n- Developer reference"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## Install and upgrade"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"The package is distributed through GitHub Releases, not npm. In **dsh-market**, find `ruisenbai/dsh-"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"annotation` under Sessions & Messages, then install or update it. The catalog uses the release's sta"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ble tarball alias; check the offered version and Host requirement before proceeding."},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Manual installation"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Install the fixed release into your `web` profile:"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"The Host must satisfy `>=0.2.2-alpha.3`; the final command must resolve `dsh-annotation@1.1.7`. For "},{"id":"p15s2","text":"a custom profile, replace both occurrences of `web` with its name. Restart that profile's running We"},{"id":"p15s3","text":"b Host, refresh the page, and check **Settings → Annotations**. Build instructions and executed veri"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"fication results are in Development and Compatibility."},{"id":"p16s1","text":"When Codex UI is enabled, annotation compatibility activates automatically to keep attached notes cl"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"ear of the input text. No setting is required; disabling Codex UI restores the standard layout. See "},{"id":"p16s3","text":"Codex UI compatibility."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"Annotation controls follow the Host's theme, rounded corners, and panel materials. The selection too"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"lbar, annotation editors, detail and attachment previews, and grouped-note menus use text one pixel "},{"id":"p17s3","text":"smaller than the conversation body; ordinary tooltips retain their own size. New-note editors have 1"},{"id":"p17s4","text":"0px vertical padding, and their text fields grow with the text up to seven visible lines. Attached-n"},{"id":"p17s5","text":"ote previews stay within the window, and narrow record panels place actions below the note text."},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### Install with an AI agent"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Give an agent with terminal access this prompt:"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Upgrading from an older Host"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Update the Host to `0.2.2-alpha.3` or newer before installing 1.1.7. The supported Host family suppl"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"ies the unified Quote text / Add annotation toolbar. Keep 1.1.6 on `0.2.2-alpha.2`, 1.1.5 on `0.2.1-"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"rc.2`, and plugin 1.1.2 while using `0.2.1-alpha.2`, 1.1.1 on `0.2.1-alpha.1`, or 1.1.0 on the `0.2."},{"id":"p22s4","text":"0` family. Drafts, source bubbles, recycle-bin records, and frozen retries retain their existing dat"},{"id":"p22s5","text":"a formats; do not clear browser storage as an upgrade step. The upgrade guide (中文) gives the version"},{"id":"p22s6","text":"s; do not clear browser storage as an upgrade step. The upgrade guide (中文) gives the version checks."},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## Supported sources"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"Use the official preview or sidebar for the source you want to review:"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"| Source                                                        | How to annotate                   "},{"id":"p25s2","text":"                                                                  | Navigation                      "},{"id":"p25s3","text":"                            |"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Assistant reply                                               | Select text within one reply and c"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"hoose **Add annotation**                                          | Bubble or record-row pin returns"},{"id":"p26s3","text":" to the saved passage       |\n| Official text, code, or Markdown file preview                 | Sele"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"ct a range or choose **Annotate this source** for the whole file                                | Op"},{"id":"p26s5","text":"ens the official preview and locates the saved range      |\n| Official HTML, image, PDF, Office, Exc"},{"id":"p26s6","text":"el, CSV, or TSV preview | Use the whole-file action; rendered text selection is available only in te"},{"id":"p26s7","text":"xt/code/Markdown previews | Retains the official resource identity and preview revision |\n| Official"},{"id":"p26s8","text":" turn Diff                                            | Open the Diff sidebar from the turn's change"},{"id":"p26s9","text":"d-file card; select a range or annotate the whole file  | Opens the same official Diff review and sa"},{"id":"p26s10","text":"ved annotation    |\n| Historical Git Diff                                           | Read existing "},{"id":"p26s11","text":"records and saved context                                                             | Read-only; n"},{"id":"p26s12","text":"o new annotation, editing, attachment, or retry |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"## Data and limitations"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"- Unsent drafts, suspended edits, retries, recycle-bin entries, and source snapshots stay in the cur"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"rent browser. They do not synchronize across browsers; clearing site data can remove them. Sent anno"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"tation records can be restored from Session history.\n- Multiple tabs coordinate local writes and pre"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"serve conflicting edits. Corrupt or future-version data is retained with an error instead of being r"},{"id":"p29s5","text":"eplaced by an empty state.\n- A selection cannot cross assistant messages. Markdown, code, and table "},{"id":"p29s6","text":"navigation depend on the Host's rendered content and available history. The plugin does not hide rea"},{"id":"p29s7","text":"soning, tools, or other conversation content.\n- Whole-file annotations require an opinion. Large sel"},{"id":"p29s8","text":"ections ask for confirmation. The default submission limits are 100 annotations and 512 KiB of encod"},{"id":"p29s9","text":"ed payload; a profile can configure them.\n- Archived Sessions have no active composer; create and at"},{"id":"p29s10","text":"tach notes in an editable Session.\n- Historical Git Diff records remain read-only. Existing submitte"},{"id":"p29s11","text":"d protocols and Session messages are not rewritten during browser-data migration.\n- DSH Web in Chrom"},{"id":"p29s12","text":"ium is the tested browser target. Other browsers, operating systems, future Host releases, and optio"},{"id":"p29s13","text":"nal third-party plugin combinations need their own verification."},{"id":"p30s1","text":"See Privacy for local data and network requests, and Data model for persistence and retry rules."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
